+ * Book Cover Keyboard (EF-DT970): an STM32 MCU at I2C 0x2a, bit-banged on the qup9 pins in GPIO mode:
+ *   TLMM South: GPIO 43 CONN detect (in, high = attached), GPIO 70 VDD_EN (3.3 V LDO), GPIO 125 SDA, GPIO 126 SCL
