+ * frame counters and the last keys (row/column/usage); `pogo off` cuts the cover's power and stops reading.
+ * Key, pointer and attach events go to /dev/pong-touch through pong_touch_post() (userland/touch.c turns them into
+ * HID services; a dylib without that bridge drops types above PONG_TOUCH_UP).
  */
 
